('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'inquiry-which-may-be-released-2', '300', 'Inquiry which may be released to the public without risking harm to the public interest.'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'h-closed-hearings-are-hearings-2', '300', 'h. "Closed hearings" are hearings of the Inquiry to which paragraphs 9 to 14 below apply. This Restriction Notice is to be read as imposing no restriction on the disclosure of any document or information:'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'between-members-core-inquiry-team-2', '300', 'a. between members of the Core Inquiry Team for purposes connected with the'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'inquiry-b-minister-hmg-advisers-2', '300', 'Inquiry; or b. to the Minister or HMG advisers.'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'restrictions-disclosure-publication-evidence-documents-2', '300', 'Restrictions on the Disclosure or Publication of Evidence or Documents given, produced or provided to the Inquiry 4 The restrictions referred to at paragraphs 5 and 7 below are imposed:'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'i-being-required-rule-law-3', '300', '(i) as being required by the rule of law known as public interest immunity; and/or'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'ii-because-minister-acting-accordance-3', '300', '(ii) because the Minister, acting in accordance with section 19(3)(b) of the Act and having had regard, in particular, to the matters set out in s19(4) of the Act,'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'appendix-7-restriction-notices-orders-3', '301', 'Appendix 7 | Restriction Notices and Orders considers it to be conducive to the Inquiry fulfilling its terms of reference and/or necessary in the public interest that such restrictions should be imposed. Otherwise than as is permitted by this Notice, no person, whether a member of the Core Inquiry Team or otherwise, may disclose or publish to any other person the Schedule to this Notice or any of the information contained in the documents identified in the Schedule to this Notice ("the Schedule material"). HMG advisers may disclose the contents of parts of the material referred to in the Schedule to this Notice to such other individuals and for such purposes as are identified in writing by the Minister to the Chairman. Save with the written agreement of the Minister, no reference shall be made by the Chairman to the Schedule material in any open ruling, judgment or report arising out of the Inquiry, or otherwise, unless it has been removed from the scope of this Notice by means of a letter under paragraph 15 below.'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'restrictions-attendance-inquiry-part-inquiry-2', '301', 'Restrictions on Attendance at the Inquiry or part of the Inquiry 8 The restrictions referred to at paragraphs 9, 12, and 14 below are imposed:'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'i-being-required-rule-law-4', '301', '(i) as being required by the rule of law known as public interest immunity; and/or'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'ii-because-minister-acting-accordance-4', '301', '(ii) because the Minister, acting in accordance with section 19(3)(b) of the Act'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'litvinenko-inquiry-109', '302', 'The Litvinenko Inquiry'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', '14-chairman-shall-ensure-no', '302', '14 The Chairman shall ensure that no reference is made to the substance of the evidence given at a closed hearing of the Inquiry in any open ruling, judgment or report arising out of the Inquiry, or otherwise.'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'amendments-restriction-notice-15-letter-2', '302', 'Amendments to this Restriction Notice 15 By letter to the Chairman under this paragraph the Minister may remove from the scope of this Notice any document or information referred to in the Schedule. The Chairman may invite the Minister to amend this Restriction Notice at any time upon providing the Minister with a draft of the proposed amendment and written reasons for it. The Minister may amend this Restriction Notice at any time. November 2014 (as amended 21 January 2015)'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'appendix-7-restriction-notices-orders-4', '303', 'Appendix 7 | Restriction Notices and Orders'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'restriction-notice-no-3', '303', 'RESTRICTION NOTICE No. 3'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'introduction-2', '303', 'Introduction'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', '1-restriction-notice-made-under-3', '303', '1 This Restriction Notice is made under section 19 of the Inquiries Act 2005 ("the Act"). For the purposes of this Restriction Notice, references to:'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'inquiry-are-references-alexander-litvinenko-3', '303', 'a. "the Inquiry" are references to the "Alexander Litvinenko Inquiry";'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'b-chairman-reference-person-appointed-3', '303', 'b. "the Chairman" is a reference to the person appointed by the Minister to chair the'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'inquiry-under-section-4-act-3', '303', 'Inquiry under section 4 of the Act, namely Sir Robert Owen;'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'c-minister-reference-secretary-state-3', '303', 'c. "the Minister" is a reference to the Secretary of State for the Home Department and, after the setting up of the Inquiry, to such other Government officials as are nominated by the Minister;'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'd-core-inquiry-team-reference-3', '303', 'd. "Core Inquiry Team" is a reference to the Chairman, counsel to the Inquiry, the solicitor to the Inquiry and such other persons as are agreed between the Minister and the Chairman and identified as such in writing;');
INSERT INTO passages (report, section, paragraph_id, page, body) VALUES
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'e-hmg-advisers-reference-counsel-3', '303', 'e. "HMG advisers" is a reference to counsel and solicitors, instructed on behalf of Her'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'majesty-s-government-such-other-3', '303', 'Majesty''s Government, and such other Government officials as are nominated by the Minister;'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'f-relevant-witnesses-are-references-3', '303', 'f. "relevant witnesses" are references to witnesses whom the Chairman directs should be called to give evidence in a closed hearing as described in paragraphs'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', '9-12-below-g-open-2', '303', '9 to 12 below; and g. "open rulings, judgments or reports" are references to rulings, judgments or reports produced by the Chairman in the course, or at the conclusion, of the'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'inquiry-which-may-be-released-3', '303', 'Inquiry which may be released to the public without risking harm to the public interest.'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'h-closed-hearings-are-hearings-3', '303', 'h. "Closed hearings" are hearings of the Inquiry to which paragraphs 9 to 14 below apply. This Restriction Notice is to be read as imposing no restriction on the disclosure of any document or information:'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'between-members-core-inquiry-team-3', '303', 'a. between members of the Core Inquiry Team for purposes connected with the'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'inquiry-b-minister-hmg-advisers-3', '303', 'Inquiry; or b. to the Minister or HMG advisers.'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'restrictions-disclosure-publication-evidence-documents-3', '303', 'Restrictions on the Disclosure or Publication of Evidence or Documents given, produced or provided to the Inquiry 4 The restrictions referred to at paragraphs 5 and 7 below are imposed:'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'i-being-required-rule-law-5', '303', '(i) as being required by the rule of law known as public interest immunity; and/or'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'ii-because-minister-acting-accordance-5', '303', '(ii) because the Minister, acting in accordance with section 19(3)(b) of the Act and having had regard, in particular, to the matters set out in s19(4) of the Act,'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'litvinenko-inquiry-considers-be-conducive', '304', 'The Litvinenko Inquiry considers it to be conducive to the Inquiry fulfilling its terms of reference and/or necessary in the public interest that such restrictions should be imposed. Otherwise than as is permitted by this Notice, no person, whether a member of the Core Inquiry Team or otherwise, may disclose or publish to any other person the Schedule to this Notice or any of the information contained in the documents identified in the Schedule to this Notice ("the Schedule material"). HMG advisers may disclose the contents of parts of the material referred to in the Schedule to this Notice to such other individuals and for such purposes as are identified in writing by the Minister to the Chairman. Save with the written agreement of the Minister, no reference shall be made by the Chairman to the Schedule material in any open ruling, judgment or report arising out of the Inquiry, or otherwise, unless it has been removed from the scope of this Notice by means of a letter under paragraph 15 below.'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'restrictions-attendance-inquiry-part-inquiry-3', '304', 'Restrictions on Attendance at the Inquiry or part of the Inquiry 8 The restrictions referred to at paragraphs 9, 12, and 14 below are imposed:'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'i-being-required-rule-law-6', '304', '(i) as being required by the rule of law known as public interest immunity; and/or'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'ii-because-minister-acting-accordance-6', '304', '(ii) because the Minister, acting in accordance with section 19(3)(b) of the Act'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'appendix-7-restriction-notices-orders-5', '305', 'Appendix 7 | Restriction Notices and Orders'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', '14-chairman-shall-ensure-no-2', '305', '14 The Chairman shall ensure that no reference is made to the substance of the evidence given at a closed hearing of the Inquiry in any open ruling, judgment or report arising out of the Inquiry, or otherwise.'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'amendments-restriction-notice-15-letter-3', '305', 'Amendments to this Restriction Notice 15 By letter to the Chairman under this paragraph the Minister may remove from the scope of this Notice any document or information referred to in the Schedule. The Chairman may invite the Minister to amend this Restriction Notice at any time upon providing the Minister with a draft of the proposed amendment and written reasons for it. The Minister may amend this Restriction Notice at any time. March 2015'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'litvinenko-inquiry-110', '306', 'The Litvinenko Inquiry'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'restriction-notice-no-4', '306', 'RESTRICTION NOTICE No. 4'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'introduction-3', '306', 'Introduction'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', '1-restriction-notice-made-under-4', '306', '1 This Restriction Notice is made under section 19 of the Inquiries Act 2005 ("the Act"). For the purposes of this Restriction Notice, references to:'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'inquiry-are-references-alexander-litvinenko-4', '306', 'a. "the Inquiry" are references to the "Alexander Litvinenko Inquiry";'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'b-chairman-reference-person-appointed-4', '306', 'b. "the Chairman" is a reference to the person appointed by the Minister to chair the'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'inquiry-under-section-4-act-4', '306', 'Inquiry under section 4 of the Act, namely Sir Robert Owen;');
INSERT INTO passages (report, section, paragraph_id, page, body) VALUES
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'c-minister-reference-secretary-state-4', '306', 'c. "the Minister" is a reference to the Secretary of State for the Home Department and, after the setting up of the Inquiry, to such other Government officials as are nominated by the Minister;'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'd-core-inquiry-team-reference-4', '306', 'd. "Core Inquiry Team" is a reference to the Chairman, counsel to the Inquiry, the solicitor to the Inquiry and such other persons as are agreed between the Minister and the Chairman and identified as such in writing;'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'e-hmg-advisers-reference-counsel-4', '306', 'e. "HMG advisers" is a reference to counsel and solicitors, instructed on behalf of Her'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'majesty-s-government-such-other-4', '306', 'Majesty''s Government, and such other Government officials as are nominated by the Minister;'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'f-relevant-witnesses-are-references-4', '306', 'f. "relevant witnesses" are references to witnesses whom the Chairman directs'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'g-open-rulings-judgments-reports-2', '306', 'g. "open rulings, judgments or reports" are references to rulings, judgments or reports produced by the Chairman in the course, or at the conclusion, of the'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'inquiry-which-may-be-released-4', '306', 'Inquiry which may be released to the public without risking harm to the public interest.'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'h-closed-hearings-are-hearings-4', '306', 'h. "Closed hearings" are hearings of the Inquiry to which paragraphs 9 to 14 below apply. This Restriction Notice is to be read as imposing no restriction on the disclosure of any document or information:'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'between-members-core-inquiry-team-4', '306', 'a. between members of the Core Inquiry Team for purposes connected with the'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'inquiry-b-minister-hmg-advisers-4', '306', 'Inquiry; or b. to the Minister or HMG advisers.'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'restrictions-disclosure-publication-evidence-documents-4', '306', 'Restrictions on the Disclosure or Publication of Evidence or Documents given, produced or provided to the Inquiry 4 The restrictions referred to at paragraphs 5 and 7 below are imposed:'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'i-being-required-rule-law-7', '306', '(i) as being required by the rule of law known as public interest immunity; and/or'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'ii-because-minister-acting-accordance-7', '306', '(ii) because the Minister, acting in accordance with section 19(3)(b) of the Act and having had regard, in particular, to the matters set out in s19(4) of the Act,'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'appendix-7-restriction-notices-orders-6', '307', 'Appendix 7 | Restriction Notices and Orders considers it to be conducive to the Inquiry fulfilling its terms of reference and/or necessary in the public interest that such restrictions should be imposed. Otherwise than as is permitted by this Notice, no person, whether a member of the Core Inquiry Team or otherwise, may disclose or publish to any other person the Schedule to this Notice or any of the information contained in the documents identified in the Schedule to this Notice ("the Schedule material"). HMG advisers may disclose the contents of parts of the material referred to in the Schedule to this Notice to such other individuals and for such purposes as are identified in writing by the Minister to the Chairman. Save with the written agreement of the Minister, no reference shall be made by the Chairman to the Schedule material in any open ruling, judgment or report arising out of the Inquiry, or otherwise, unless it has been removed from the scope of this Notice by means of a letter under paragraph 15 below.'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'restrictions-attendance-inquiry-part-inquiry-4', '307', 'Restrictions on Attendance at the Inquiry or part of the Inquiry 8 The restrictions referred to at paragraphs 9, 12, and 14 below are imposed:'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'i-being-required-rule-law-8', '307', '(i) as being required by the rule of law known as public interest immunity; and/or'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'ii-because-minister-acting-accordance-8', '307', '(ii) because the Minister, acting in accordance with section 19(3)(b) of the Act'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'litvinenko-inquiry-111', '308', 'The Litvinenko Inquiry'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', '14-chairman-shall-ensure-no-3', '308', '14 The Chairman shall ensure that no reference is made to the substance of the evidence given at a closed hearing of the Inquiry in any open ruling, judgment or report arising out of the Inquiry, or otherwise.'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'amendments-restriction-notice-15-letter-4', '308', 'Amendments to this Restriction Notice 15 By letter to the Chairman under this paragraph the Minister may remove from the scope of this Notice any document or information referred to in the Schedule. The Chairman may invite the Minister to amend this Restriction Notice at any time upon providing the Minister with a draft of the proposed amendment and written reasons for it. The Minister may amend this Restriction Notice at any time. June 2015'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'appendix-7-restriction-notices-orders-7', '309', 'Appendix 7 | Restriction Notices and Orders'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'witness-anonymity-screening-1-there', '309', 'Witness Anonymity and Screening 1 There shall be no disclosure or publication of any information that identifies or tends to identify the individuals referred to in paragraph 2 below, who were the subject of anonymity orders made in the course of the Litvinenko inquest, and they shall continue to be referred to using the initials listed in paragraph 2. The individuals in question are:'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'a3-b-c2-c-c3', '309', 'a. A3 b. C2 c. C3 d. D3 e. D6 f. D7'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', '3-event-a3-required-attend', '309', '3 In the event that A3 is required to attend and give evidence at the public hearing of the Inquiry, his physical appearance will be concealed from the public, the media and core participants, but not from the Chairman, Counsel to the Inquiry or Counsel for the core participants. Until further order, there shall be no disclosure or publication of any information that identifies or tends to identify the individuals referred to in the inquest proceedings as D1, D2 and C1 as the individuals who were previously referred to in that way; this is to ensure that until further order there shall be no reference to the fact that they had applied for anonymity. For the avoidance of doubt, this order does not prevent the disclosure or publication of the identities of those individuals in the absence of any link to their previous pseudonyms.'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'order-made-under-section-19', '309', 'This Order is made under section 19(1) of the Inquiries Act 2005 and binds all members of the public, including Core Participants.');
INSERT INTO passages (report, section, paragraph_id, page, body) VALUES
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'case-public-authorities-restrictions-specified', '309', 'In the case of public authorities, the restrictions specified in this Order take effect subject to the terms of section 20(6) of the Inquiries Act 2005.'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'any-person-affected-order-may', '309', 'Any person affected by this Order may apply in accordance with section 20 of the Inquiries Act 2005 to vary its terms.'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'sir-robert-owen', '309', 'Sir Robert Owen'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', '9-october-2014', '309', '9 October 2014'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'litvinenko-inquiry-112', '310', 'The Litvinenko Inquiry'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'witness-anonymity-screening-1-there-2', '310', 'Witness Anonymity and Screening 1 There shall be no disclosure or publication of any information that identifies or tends to identify the individual referred to in these proceedings as A1. In the event that A1 is required to attend and give evidence at the public hearing of the Inquiry, her physical appearance will be concealed from the public, the media and core participants, but not from the Chairman, Counsel to the Inquiry or Counsel for the core participants. In the event that the individuals referred to in these proceedings as C2, C3, D3, D6 and D7 are required to attend and give evidence at the public hearing of the Inquiry, their physical appearance will be concealed from the public, the media and core participants, but not from the Chairman, Counsel to the Inquiry or Counsel for the core participants.'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'order-made-under-section-19-2', '310', 'This Order is made under section 19(1) of the Inquiries Act 2005 and binds all members of the public, including Core Participants.'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'case-public-authorities-restrictions-specified-2', '310', 'In the case of public authorities, the restrictions specified in this Order take effect subject to the terms of section 20(6) of the Inquiries Act 2005.'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'any-person-affected-order-may-2', '310', 'Any person affected by this Order may apply in accordance with section 20 of the Inquiries Act 2005 to vary its terms.'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'sir-robert-owen-2', '310', 'Sir Robert Owen'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', '14-november-2014', '310', '14 November 2014'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'appendix-7-restriction-notices-orders-8', '311', 'Appendix 7 | Restriction Notices and Orders'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'witness-anonymity-screening-1-there-3', '311', 'Witness Anonymity and Screening 1 There shall be no disclosure or publication of any information that identifies or tends to identify the individual who will be referred to henceforth in these proceedings as D9. D9''s identity is stated in the Annex to this Order, which will be served on core participants only. In the event that D9 is required to attend and give evidence at the public hearing of the Inquiry, his physical appearance will be concealed from the public, the media and core participants, but not from the Chairman, Counsel to the Inquiry, Counsel for the core participants or security cleared inquiry staff. The screening orders dated 9 October 2014 (made in relation to A3) and 14 November 2014 (made in relation to A1 and also in relation to C2, C3, D3, D6 and D7) are varied so that in the event the said individuals give evidence, their physical appearance will not be concealed from security cleared inquiry staff.'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'order-made-under-section-19-3', '311', 'This Order is made under section 19(1) of the Inquiries Act 2005 and binds all members of the public, including Core Participants.'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'case-public-authorities-restrictions-specified-3', '311', 'In the case of public authorities, the restrictions specified in this Order take effect subject to the terms of section 20(6) of the Inquiries Act 2005.'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'any-person-affected-order-may-3', '311', 'Any person affected by this Order may apply in accordance with section 20 of the Inquiries Act 2005 to vary its terms.'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'sir-robert-owen-3', '311', 'Sir Robert Owen'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', '27-november-2014', '311', '27 November 2014'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'litvinenko-inquiry-113', '312', 'The Litvinenko Inquiry'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'witness-anonymity-screening-screening-orders', '312', 'Witness Anonymity and Screening The screening orders dated 9 October 2014 (made in relation to A3), November 2014 (made in relation to A1 and also in relation to C2, C3, D3, D6 and D7) and 27 November 2014 (made in relation to D9) are varied so that in the event that the said individuals give evidence, their physical appearance need not be concealed from any other person whom the Chairman directs.'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'order-made-under-section-19-4', '312', 'This Order is made under section 19(1) of the Inquiries Act 2005 and binds all members of the public, including Core Participants.'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'case-public-authorities-restrictions-specified-4', '312', 'In the case of public authorities, the restrictions specified in this Order take effect subject to the terms of section 20(6) of the Inquiries Act 2005.'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'any-person-affected-order-may-4', '312', 'Any person affected by this Order may apply in accordance with section 20 of the Inquiries Act 2005 to vary its terms.'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'sir-robert-owen-4', '312', 'Sir Robert Owen'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', '28-january-2015', '312', '28 January 2015');
INSERT INTO passages (report, section, paragraph_id, page, body) VALUES
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'G-BNWB)', 'appendix-7-restriction-notices-orders-9', '313', 'Appendix 7 | Restriction Notices and Orders'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'RESTRICTION ORDER', 'evidence-witness-g-further-application', '313', 'Evidence of Witness G Further to an application for anonymity received from Witness G, I made a provisional ruling in favour of granting him this by means of a Restriction Order. That provisional ruling is dated 25 September 2015 and was provided to Core Participants and media representatives on that date so that they might make submissions upon it. I received no such submissions and I now make the following order for the reasons set out in the provisional ruling. There shall be no disclosure or publication of any information that identifies or tends to identify Witness G. Other than with the express written permission of the Chairman, there shall be no disclosure or publication of the further evidence given by Witness G referred to in the provisional ruling.'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'RESTRICTION ORDER', 'order-made-under-section-19-5', '313', 'This Order is made under section 19(1) of the Inquiries Act 2005 and binds all members of the public, including Core Participants.'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'RESTRICTION ORDER', 'case-public-authorities-restrictions-specified-5', '313', 'In the case of public authorities, the restrictions specified in this Order take effect subject to the terms of section 20(6) of the Inquiries Act 2005.'),
